{'symbol': 'CTRA', 'date': '2021-11-03 06:30:00', 'title': 'COTERRA ENERGY REPORTS THIRD-QUARTER 2021 RESULTS AND ACCELERATES VARIABLE DIVIDEND', 'text': 'HOUSTON, NOV. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COTERRA ENERGY INC. (NYSE: CTRA)\xa0("COTERRA" OR THE "COMPANY") TODAY REPORTED THIRD-QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS. ON OCTOBER 1, 2021, COTERRA ANNOUNCED THAT THE MERGER INVOLVING THE COMPANY, WHICH PREVIOUSLY WAS NAMED CABOT OIL & GAS CORPORATION ("CABOT"), AND CIMAREX ENERGY CO. ("CIMAREX") WAS COMPLETED.'}